+{{header}}
+% Handmade Type3 boxes; each word is a complete two-letter ToUnicode mapping.
+% FATHA is a leading zero-width orphan, not assigned to a base by these tests.
+% Its source-first position excludes the single-line semantic helper.
+% Page 0 reproduces the reviewed descending-position witness exactly:
+% mark/BEH-TEH at x=180, SPACE at x=160, JEEM-HAH at x=140, all y=100.
+% Positive TJ operands subtract advance: 10 - 30 = -20 points per step.
+% Page 1 has ascending word origins 100,120,140, with the orphan on the
+% unrelated leftmost block. RTL word order must give the unmarked phrase
+% BEH-TEH SPACE JEEM-HAH before the unchanged FATHA DAL-DHAL block.
+% Page 2 puts both words at x=100. Page 3 uses x=140,180,160. These ambiguous
+% position cases preserve prior extraction; they do not assert reading order.
+% Page 4 wraps page 0 in [-1 0 0 -1 300 200] cm and /Rotate 180. The raster
+% stays upright, but local a=d=-1 and source-plane word origins become 120,160.
+% Preserve page 0's text/indices, using transformed boxes and hit coordinates.
+{{object 1 0}} << /Type /Catalog /Pages 2 0 R >>
+endobj
+{{object 2 0}} <<
+  /Type /Pages /Count 5 /Kids [3 0 R 4 0 R 5 0 R 6 0 R 16 0 R]
+  /MediaBox [0 0 300 200]
+  /Resources << /Font << /F1 11 0 R >> >>
+>>
+endobj
+{{object 3 0}} << /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /Contents 7 0 R >>
+endobj
+{{object 4 0}} << /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /Contents 8 0 R >>
+endobj
+{{object 5 0}} << /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /Contents 9 0 R >>
+endobj
+{{object 6 0}} << /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /Contents 10 0 R >>
+endobj
+{{object 7 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+BT /F1 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 180 100 Tm [<04> <01> 1500 <05> 1500 <02>] TJ ET
+endstream
+endobj
+{{object 8 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+BT /F1 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 100 100 Tm [<04> <03> <05> <02> <05> <01>] TJ ET
+endstream
+endobj
+{{object 9 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+BT /F1 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 100 100 Tm [<04> <01> 500 <05> 500 <02>] TJ ET
+endstream
+endobj
+{{object 10 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+BT /F1 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 140 100 Tm [<04> <01> -500 <05> -500 <02> 1000 <05> 1000 <03>] TJ ET
+endstream
+endobj
+{{object 11 0}} <<
+  /Type /Font /Subtype /Type3
+  /FontBBox [0 0 2000 1000] /FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0]
+  /CharProcs << /base 12 0 R /mark 13 0 R /space 14 0 R >>
+  /Encoding << /Type /Encoding /Differences [1 /base /base /base /mark /space] >>
+  /FirstChar 1 /LastChar 5 /Widths [500 500 500 0 500]
+  /Resources << >> /ToUnicode 15 0 R
+>>
+endobj
+{{object 12 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+500 0 0 0 500 800 d1
+0 0 500 800 re f
+endstream
+endobj
+{{object 13 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+0 0 200 900 300 1000 d1
+200 900 100 100 re f
+endstream
+endobj
+{{object 14 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+500 0 0 0 0 0 d1
+endstream
+endobj
+{{object 15 0}} <<
+  {{streamlen}}
+>>
+stream
+/CIDInit /ProcSet findresource begin
